<title>RUSSIA: Russia Pallada GKO fund assets 7 mln roubles.</title>
<headline>Russia Pallada GKO fund assets 7 mln roubles.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pallada Government Securities Unit Investment Fund, which started operating on November 12, said its net assets totalled 7,488,225 roubles.</p>
<p>A unit in the fund costs 10,000 roubles, a fund spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
